id: pm-vcs-ttc0
title: Served repository over the Phase 3 transport
description: "Serve one repository or a directory of repositories through the existing async Phase 3 transport over node:http. Includes ref advertisement, verified fetch/upload, atomic push/publication, standalone series object download, review records, HTTP(S) client clone/fetch/push and capability negotiation. Unauthenticated serving is read-only by default and permits writes only when --allow-unauthenticated-writes is set. Real socket, packed Node/Bun and multi-process PM record acceptance evidence is linked in comments and tests. Verified and closed by the orchestrator after PR #91 merged (186adf1)."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-28T13:43:10.824Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-07T00:34:02.848Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-07T00:25:35.376Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-07T00:25:35.376Z"
author: pi-agent
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
